<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/38/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue is hereby authorized of a sum not exceeding nine billion seven hundred eighty-six million seven hundred forty-three thousand five hundred and ten ringgit (RM9,786,743,510) from the Consolidated Fund for expenditure on the services and purposes specified in the Schedule for the year 2007 not provided for or not fully provided for by the Supply Act 2007 [Act A1276]."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/38/eng@> .
